<h2>Waukesha claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Our Waukesha County condo association disagrees with the carrier on a roof claim. Can you help?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. We work with associations on master policy claims, documenting damage across buildings and preparing estimates for the appraisal process.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does my policy cover my dock or boathouse on the lake?</summary><div class="a"><p>Coverage for docks and boathouses varies widely. Some policies cover them as other structures; others limit or exclude them. Appraisal settles the amount of a covered loss, not whether coverage applies.</p></div></details></div>
